      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Have debugged this with Phase's help.\nWhen enabling an object using a pool and then firing a custom event on it immediately, network instructions like SetOwner, RequestSerialization etc do not work.\nYou have to wait until when OnEnable of the enabled object is fired.\nThis doesn't look like it's correct, but I've got a 100% reproduction of this I can demonstrate in my 8 pool table world and just spent an engaging hour demonstrating it :D",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
