  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In an object pool with objects with an UdonBehaviour inside, running TryToSpawn to get a Behaviour, then firing RequestSerialization on that Behaviour, will not fire that data - it's as if the Serialization never happened.\nIn addition, RPCs cannot be fired from recently-enabled object pooled Behaviours. (OnEnable -> fire an All RPC to self only is received locally if you are remote, and is never received by the owner even if they fire it).",
